  <data key="d0">Human-Centered</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Human-Centered is a core principle of Design Thinking, focusing on understanding and addressing real user needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Human-centered is a principle of Design Thinking that focuses on understanding and addressing real user needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Human-Centered is a principle of Design Thinking that focuses on real user needs.</data>
