<node id="Iterative">
  <data key="d0">Iterative</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Iterative is a principle of Design Thinking that emphasizes continuous refinement of ideas and solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Iterative is a principle of Design Thinking that emphasizes continuous refinement of ideas and solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Iterative is a principle of Design Thinking that involves continuously refining ideas and solutions.</data>
