  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Collaborative is a principle of Design Thinking that emphasizes cross-functional teamwork to solve complex challenges.&lt;SEP&gt;Collaborative is a principle of Design Thinking that involves cross-functional teams and stakeholders working together.&lt;SEP&gt;Collaborative is a principle of Design Thinking that involves cross-functional teams and stakeholders.</data>
