<node id="Story Points">
  <data key="d0">Story Points</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Story Points are a unit of measure used by Agile teams to estimate the effort, complexity, and risk of completing a user story.&lt;SEP&gt;Story Points are a unit of measure used by Agile teams to estimate the effort, complexity, and risk of completing a user story.&lt;SEP&gt;Story Points are a unit of measure used by Agile teams to estimate the effort, complexity, and risk of completing a user story.&lt;SEP&gt;Story Points are a unit of measure used in Agile estimation to assess the effort, complexity, and risk of completing a user story.&lt;SEP&gt;Story Points are a unit of measure used in Agile to estimate the effort, complexity, and risk of completing a user story.</data>
