<node id="Effort Mapping">
  <data key="d0">Effort Mapping</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Effort Mapping is a technique that links Story Points to equivalent effort durations, helping teams estimate tasks based on complexity and time.&lt;SEP&gt;Effort Mapping is a technique that maps story points to equivalent effort in days, helping teams estimate tasks based on complexity and risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4df9cb7b8cf1803448d29a16d8b2927f</data>
