  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Cross-Functional Teams are groups composed of members from different areas of expertise working collaboratively on shared goals.&lt;SEP&gt;Cross-Functional Teams are groups composed of members from different areas of expertise working collaboratively on shared goals.&lt;SEP&gt;Cross-Functional Teams are groups composed of members from different areas of expertise working collaboratively on shared goals.&lt;SEP&gt;Cross-Functional Teams are groups composed of members from different areas of expertise, collaborating to solve complex challenges.</data>
