<node id="Empathize">
  <data key="d0">Empathize</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Empathize is the first stage of the Design Thinking process, focusing on understanding users, their environment, and challenges through interviews, observation, and empathy mapping.&lt;SEP&gt;Empathize is the first stage of the Design Thinking process, focusing on understanding users, their environment, and their challenges through interviews, observation, and other tools.&lt;SEP&gt;Empathize is the first step in the Design Thinking process, focusing on understanding users, their environment, and challenges through interviews, observation, and empathy mapping.&lt;SEP&gt;Empathize is the first step in the Design Thinking process, focusing on understanding users, their environment, and challenges through interviews, observation, and empathy mapping.&lt;SEP&gt;Empathize is the first step in the Design Thinking process, focusing on understanding users, their environment, and challenges through interviews, observation, and empathy mapping.</data>
