<node id="Define">
  <data key="d0">Define</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Define is the second stage of the Design Thinking process, aimed at synthesizing insights and clearly articulating the problem to be solved.&lt;SEP&gt;Define is the second stage of the Design Thinking process, where insights from the Empathize stage are synthesized to clearly articulate the problem to be solved.&lt;SEP&gt;Define is the second step in the Design Thinking process, aimed at synthesizing insights and clearly articulating the problem to be solved using tools like problem statements and affinity diagrams.&lt;SEP&gt;Define is the second step in the Design Thinking process, aimed at synthesizing insights and clearly articulating the problem to be solved using tools like problem statements and affinity diagrams.&lt;SEP&gt;Define is the second step in the Design Thinking process, aimed at synthesizing insights and clearly articulating the problem to be solved using tools like problem statements and affinity diagrams.</data>
