<node id="Ideate">
  <data key="d0">Ideate</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Ideate is the third stage of the Design Thinking process, aimed at generating a wide range of creative solutions through brainstorming, mind mapping, and other techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;Ideate is the third stage of the Design Thinking process, encouraging divergent thinking to generate a wide range of creative solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Ideate is the third step in the Design Thinking process, encouraging divergent thinking to generate creative solutions through brainstorming, mind mapping, and sketching.&lt;SEP&gt;Ideate is the third step in the Design Thinking process, encouraging divergent thinking to generate creative solutions through brainstorming, mind mapping, and sketching.&lt;SEP&gt;Ideate is the third step in the Design Thinking process, encouraging divergent thinking to generate creative solutions through brainstorming, mind mapping, and sketching.</data>
