  <data key="d0">Sarah Martinez</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Sarah Martinez is a 34-year-old Project Manager whose primary goals include keeping team projects on schedule, reducing meeting time, and improving cross-team visibility. She faces challenges such as tool overload, difficult onboarding for new team members, and poor integration with reporting systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Sarah Martinez is a 34-year-old Project Manager whose primary goals include keeping team projects on schedule, reducing meeting time, and improving cross-team visibility. She faces challenges such as tool overload, difficult onboarding for new team members, and poor integration with reporting systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Sarah Martinez is a 34-year-old project manager and an example persona representing professionals in her role. Her primary goals include keeping team projects on schedule, reducing meeting time, and improving cross-team visibility. However, she faces significant challenges such as tool overload, difficult onboarding for new team members, and poor integration with reporting systems. Sarah uses tools like Slack, Jira, Excel, and Salesforce to manage her work and values solutions that simplify work processes and enhance efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Sarah Martinez is an example persona representing a 34-year-old project manager who aims to keep team projects on schedule, reduce meeting time, and improve cross-team visibility while facing challenges like tool overload and poor integration.&lt;SEP&gt;Sarah Martinez is an example persona representing a 34-year-old project manager who aims to keep team projects on schedule, reduce meeting time, and improve cross-team visibility while facing challenges like tool overload and poor integration.</data>
