  <data key="d7">User/Business Value is one of the components used to calculate Cost of Delay.&lt;SEP&gt;User/Business Value is one of the components used to calculate Cost of Delay.&lt;SEP&gt;User/Business Value is one of the components used to calculate Cost of Delay.&lt;SEP&gt;User/Business Value is one of the components used to calculate Cost of Delay.&lt;SEP&gt;User/Business Value is one of the three components used to calculate Cost of Delay.</data>
