<edge source="Time Criticality" target="Cost Of Delay (CoD)">
  <data key="d6">56.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Time Criticality and Cost Of Delay (CoD) are closely related concepts. Time Criticality is a key factor and one of the three components used to calculate the Cost Of Delay. It specifically measures the urgency associated with a task, project, or decision, highlighting how time-sensitive the situation is. This relationship underscores the importance of Time Criticality in determining the overall impact of delays on value delivery.</data>
